  "remarks": "Sharia amir of Al-Nusrah Front for the People of the Levant (Qde.137) as of early 2014. Title: Amir \nReview pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 4 Dec. 2019 Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2610 (2021) was concluded on 30 October 2023.  Reportedly died in the Syrian Arab Republic on 2 April 2024.  Mother's name: Subhah Muhammad Sayf.; Listing: Listed on 23 Sep. 2014 (amended 6 Dec 2019, 30 Oct 2023, 2 Dec 2024)",
